@NODE MAIN "EmojiGear - Unicode Text Editor"

@{b}EmojiGear v5.3@{ub}
Unicode Text Editor for AmigaOS 3.2.x (68k)

@{i}A UTF-8 text editor with full Emoji and Unicode support,@{ui}
@{i}powered by a custom FreeType 2 rendering engine.@{ui}

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

